 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "The Four Color Theorem in Lean 4",
  "excerpt": "A Lean 4 + Mathlib port of Georges Gonthier's Coq/Rocq formal proof of the Four Color Theorem, [math-comp/fourcolor](https://github.com/math-comp/fourcolor) (ported from commit `c1d6b1cd5288bea4b067aac13cdde3c18dffe018`). It is written for the Palomar registry's standards: the proof may use only the axioms `propext`, `Classical.choice` and `Quot.sound`, and every computation in it is checked by the Lean kernel (`decide +kernel`, never `native_decide`)."
 },
